.TL
Heart: The City Beneath
.SH
Classes
.LP
A character in Heart takes one of the following classes.
.IP
The Cleave, a berserker who fights with fury.
.IP
The Deadwalker, who speaks with the dead.
.IP
The Deep Apiarist, host to a hive of impossible bees.
.IP
The Heretic, who wields stolen divine power.
.IP
The Hound, a tracker bonded to a beast.
.IP
The Incarnadine, a merchant of blood and gold.
.IP
The Junk Mage, casting spells from salvaged parts.
.IP
The Vermissian Knight, sworn to the broken transit network.
.IP
The Witch, who bargains with the powers below.
.LP
Each class has its own abilities and resistances.
